; This plugin lives inside the Strapi app (src/plugins), so its peer dependencies
; (@strapi/strapi, @strapi/design-system, @strapi/icons, react, react-dom,
; react-router-dom, styled-components) are resolved from the app's node_modules by
; walking up the tree. Installing them here too would give the admin build a second
; copy of React / styled-components and break their context.
omit=peer
